    "solution": "Step 1: Dividing Componendo \\(\\frac{a+b}{b} = \\frac{c+d}{d}\\) by Dividendo \\(\\frac{a-b}{b} = \\frac{c-d}{d}\\) gives \\(\\frac{a+b}{a-b} = \\frac{c+d}{c-d}\\).\nStep 2: This composite property is termed Componendo-Dividendo.\nStep 3: Hence, the property is Componendo-Dividendo.",
